  - headerText: Dashing
    bodyText: 'Let''s see how this helps us! You have already stumbled upon an energy
      barrier with a green glow. These barriers are similar to ones in the quantum
      world. Luckily, our Quantum Tunneling Activator can help us cross them!


      By
      pressing the Shift key, you can temporarily leverage the power of probablistic
      waves to phase straight through these green barriers!'
    illustrationMode: 2
    illustration: {fileID: 0}
